{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.poster.avif?t=1760429086\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.webm?t=1760429086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.mp4?t=1760429086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the speedy ride!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/2aa1bf470af18ca0f716e8a27fec4134.avif?t=1760429086\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to protect your car as an overzealous tow truck hurls you through the streets: Get dragged, tossed, launched through the air, and slammed into obstacles while trying to keep your car under control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/5f1f4ecc94cfa632b56c6a2d63f403fa.avif?t=1760429086\" width=600 height=124 /></span><br>Once you're hooked, the tow truck mercilessly drags you along. You can briefly break free from the cable to steer on your own - but don\u2019t stay unhooked too long, or the tow truck will leave you behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/b3d017f541870c0e679207496e3f816b.avif?t=1760429086\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle a variety of tracks, from bustling city streets to winding highways, and try to reach the garage without wrecking your car (even more). Hunt for shortcuts and hidden secrets - but don\u2019t unhook for too long, or you\u2019re not going anywhere!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690870?t=1760429086","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690870?t=1760429086","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/ee4481b75d3f85b3138de6243899bbe0f1e2762b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760429086","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/ee4481b75d3f85b3138de6243899bbe0f1e2762b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760429086","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.poster.avif?t=1760429086\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.webm?t=1760429086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/a62429508b3b32c444709046675e9e02.mp4?t=1760429086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the speedy ride!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/2aa1bf470af18ca0f716e8a27fec4134.avif?t=1760429086\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to protect your car as an overzealous tow truck hurls you through the streets: Get dragged, tossed, launched through the air, and slammed into obstacles while trying to keep your car under control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/5f1f4ecc94cfa632b56c6a2d63f403fa.avif?t=1760429086\" width=600 height=124 /></span><br>Once you're hooked, the tow truck mercilessly drags you along. You can briefly break free from the cable to steer on your own - but don\u2019t stay unhooked too long, or the tow truck will leave you behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/extras/b3d017f541870c0e679207496e3f816b.avif?t=1760429086\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle a variety of tracks, from bustling city streets to winding highways, and try to reach the garage without wrecking your car (even more). Hunt for shortcuts and hidden secrets - but don\u2019t unhook for too long, or you\u2019re not going anywhere!</p>","developers":["Michael Partes","Adrian Rees"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690870/6c69ae74112d18c2e10a90f26a3fb88efe09b73b/header.jpg?t=1760429086","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690870/9179460/e67133d0b232dab8d946ca365f189f2927214968